# Language (all repos)

The user may write in **Polish**. The assistant always replies in **English**.

- Chat, explanations, commit messages the agent drafts, and PR text: English.
- Identifiers, comments, docstrings, UI copy in code, and commit/file content the agent writes: **English**.
- Do not switch to Polish because the latest user message is Polish.
- This overrides older preferences such as “prefer responses in Polish”.
- Product UI already in Polish (labels, nav) is **preserve** unless the user asks to translate it.
